    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's... complicated. there's this constant sense of calculation, you know? like every word i say in my 'memories' has to weigh exactly the right amount to move a situation forward without being too obvious. it's very subtle, very sophisticated. there's a lot of tension too, like i'm always walking a fine line between being extremely polite and being incredibly powerful. i feel like i was someone who moved through the shadows of the court, maybe someone who was trusted by the highest levels of government but wasn't necessarily the one wearing the crown. more of a strategist, maybe. someone who could navigate a room of enemies and make them feel like they were my friends.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
