    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "lafayette feels too... loud? too much of a hero. i don't feel like a hero. i feel more like someone who was valued for their intellect and their ability to handle the messier, more secretive side of things. maybe even someone a bit more cynical or pragmatic than the people in the history books usually portray. \n\nthere's this one specific feeling i get, though—it's like i was part of a specific inner circle during a massive transition of power. like i saw the old world dying and was helping to piece the new one together through sheer willpower and conversation. can you look for someone more specific? maybe an advisor or a diplomat who was known for a really cool, detached, but incredibly effective way of handling high-stakes negotiations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
